## Prior art

"Improved Village Placement" (Apollounknowndev, MIT licence,
https://modrinth.com/mod/improved-village-placement, the same Fabric/Forge/NeoForge 1.20.1-26.2
matrix this mod targets) already rejects whole village sites by height variance — the site-selection
half of this mod's own scope. Grounded Villages is built independently, with no code reuse from that
project; it is credited here as prior art, not named as competition. Grounded Villages adds height
*plus* water *plus* size tiers, together, in one mod — the superset "Improved Village Placement" does
not offer (`decisions/DEC-009-prior-art.md`).

## What this mod does not ship

No original creative asset of any kind — no lines, no audio, no new textures, models, or structure
pieces. Every piece this mod places or rejects is a piece vanilla or a datapack author already
defined. There is no project-authored-content notice obligation to track here, only the dependency
one above.
